<title>FRANCE: Paribas not in talks to sell Via Banque.</title>
<headline>Paribas not in talks to sell Via Banque.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paribas is not in talks about selling its unit Via Banque, a Paribas spokesman said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;There are no negotiations under way about the sale of Via Banque,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>Via Banque shares ended the day sharply higher on Friday, rising 10 percent to 135.30 francs on rumours Paribas was planning to sell Via Banque soon. Paribas acquired Via Banque when it took over holding company Navigation Mixte.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
